        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:41:32.923Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It took a lot of restraint, but I actually finally have nothing to say about this episode except that it was delightful, one of my favorites.  The digressions with C&amp;A discussing Taco Bell and being in their own universe and so forth…chef’s kiss.  So much delight, and only moderate temptation for me to write some giant wall of text where I quibble with them from six years ago about like two words they said “wrong”.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/laughing.png?v=12\" title=\":laughing:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":laughing:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
